# Build context ignore rules for docker/Dockerfile.bun-ubuntu-slim ONLY.
#
# BuildKit automatically uses this file instead of the repo-root .dockerignore
# when the build targets this Dockerfile (`-f docker/Dockerfile.bun-ubuntu-slim`).
# It fully replaces the root .dockerignore (no merge).
#
# This image is a base image (Ubuntu + Bun from github.com/oven-sh/bun); it does
# not install Matterbridge or use any source. The only thing it copies from the
# context is docker/entrypoint.bun-ubuntu-slim.sh, so we ignore everything else.

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...except the single entrypoint this Dockerfile copies.
!docker/entrypoint.bun-ubuntu-slim.sh
